---
import Profile from "../components/Profile.astro";
import Page from "../layouts/Page.astro";
---

<Page title="About" description="Background, education, skills and contact details for JD, a cybersecurity engineer and cloud security architect.">
  <Profile
    name="JD"
    headline="Cybersecurity Engineer | Cloud Security Architect"
  >
    <section class="profile-card wide" aria-labelledby="about-h">
      <h2 id="about-h">About</h2>
      <p>
        I started in banking and investing, where the job was protecting people's money and trust.
        Now I design systems that protect them by default.
      </p>
      <p>
        I am completing a Master of Engineering in Cybersecurity Engineering at the University of
        San Diego, with a focus on cloud security architecture, OPSEC and secure development. I
        learn by building, so I treat my own projects like production systems.
      </p>
      <p>
        This site is one of them: a static site on Cloudflare Workers with a strict content
        security policy and no third-party code, a locked-down repository, pinned and scanned
        build pipelines, and build provenance with an SBOM on every release.
      </p>
      <p>
        I also built and hardened a homelab of my own: an OPNsense firewall with segmented VLANs
        and an isolated security lab that cannot reach the rest of the network, default-deny
        rules, key-only SSH reached through a WireGuard VPN, and encrypted backups with tested
        restores.
      </p>
      <p>
        I am comfortable working with AWS, Azure and GCP, including identity and access (IAM),
        infrastructure as code with Terraform, SIEM and detection work, and AI security.
      </p>
      <p>
        Right now I am interested in opportunities where AI is applied to cybersecurity: finding
        threats faster, automating security operations and keeping cloud environments safe at
        scale, as well as securing the AI systems themselves. I am looking for cloud security,
        security engineering and architecture roles where I can keep growing my technical skills
        on work that matters.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="profile-card" aria-labelledby="experience-h">
      <h2 id="experience-h">Experience</h2>
      <ul class="rows">
        <li>
          <p class="label">Nov 2020 - Jan 2023</p>
          <h3>Financial Services Specialist, Vanguard</h3>
          <p>Investment management and foreign investment work.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <p class="label">Dec 2019 - Sep 2020</p>
          <h3>Financial Analyst Intern, Creative Financial Group</h3>
          <p>Financial services and financial modeling.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <p class="label">Jan 2016 - Dec 2019</p>
          <h3>Bank Teller, Chase</h3>
          <p>Customer service and banking.</p>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="profile-card" aria-labelledby="education-h">
      <h2 id="education-h">Education</h2>
      <ul class="rows">
        <li>
          <p class="label">2026 - 2027</p>
          <h3>Master of Engineering, Cybersecurity Engineering</h3>
          <p>University of San Diego</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <p class="label">2016 - 2020</p>
          <h3>B.S. International Business, Banking and Financial Support Services</h3>
          <p>West Chester University of Pennsylvania</p>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="profile-card wide" aria-labelledby="labs-h">
      <h2 id="labs-h">Labs and training</h2>
      <ul class="rows">
        <li>
          <h3>Hack The Box</h3>
          <p>Offensive security machines and challenges. Profile link to be added.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <h3>PortSwigger Web Security Academy</h3>
          <p>Web application attack labs from the makers of Burp Suite. Profile link to be added.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <h3>CyberDefenders</h3>
          <p>Blue team labs in forensics, threat hunting and incident response. Profile link to be added.</p>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="profile-card wide" aria-labelledby="skills-h">
      <h2 id="skills-h">Skills</h2>
      <ul class="tags" aria-label="Skills">
        <li>cloud security architecture</li>
        <li>AWS, Azure and GCP</li>
        <li>cloud identity and access (IAM)</li>
        <li>infrastructure as code (Terraform)</li>
        <li>SIEM and detection</li>
        <li>Splunk</li>
        <li>Microsoft Sentinel</li>
        <li>AI security</li>
        <li>OPSEC</li>
        <li>network security</li>
        <li>network segmentation</li>
        <li>firewalls (OPNsense)</li>
        <li>WireGuard</li>
        <li>DNS filtering (Pi-hole)</li>
        <li>Linux</li>
        <li>Docker</li>
        <li>Cloudflare</li>
        <li>GitHub Actions</li>
        <li>security headers and CSP</li>
        <li>scripting</li>
        <li>financial services</li>
      </ul>
    </section>
  </Profile>
</Page>
